  "solution": "Given equation: (9 ÷ 3 + 169 × 13) ÷ 5 - 10 + 16 = 206\n\nBODMAS Table: \n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/d50192f098c21078501d30eeafe1a8c64bc30dd9621c48caa8a39ffc60f68b64.png] \n\nLet's check each option one by one.\n\nOption 1) × and - \n\nGiven: (9 ÷ 3 + 169 × 13) ÷ 5 - 10 + 16 = 206\n\nAfter interchanging the signs we get;\n\n⇒ (__**9 ÷ 3**__ + 169 - 13) ÷ 5 × 10 + 16 = 206\n\n⇒ (__**3 + 169**__ - 13) ÷ 5 × 10 + 16 = 206\n\n⇒ (__**172 - 13**__) ÷ 5 × 10 + 16 = 206\n\n⇒ __**159**____** ÷ 5**__ × 10 + 16 = 206\n\n⇒ **__31.8__**__** × 10**__ + 16 = 206\n\n⇒ __318 + 16__ = 206\n\n⇒ 334 ≠ 206\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\n**Option 2) ÷ and ×**\n\nGiven: (9 ÷ 3 + 169 × 13) ÷ 5 - 10 + 16 = 206\n\nAfter interchanging the signs we get;\n\n⇒ (9 × 3 + __**169 ÷ 13**__) × 5 - 10 + 16 = 206\n\n⇒ &l",
